# mush

> A MIDI and Audio shell workspace — standalone reedline REPLs, a unified shell, and a nushell plugin, all sharing common domain cores.

## Project Structure

```
mush/
├── crates/
│   ├── mush-core/        # REPL engine + Shell trait (reedline)
│   ├── mish-midi-core/        # MIDI domain logic (no REPL dependency)
│   ├── mash-audio-core/        # Audio domain logic (no REPL dependency)
│   ├── mish-shell/       # Standalone MIDI reedline REPL  → binary: mish
│   ├── mash-shell/       # Standalone Audio reedline REPL → binary: mash
│   ├── mush-shell/       # Unified MIDI + Audio REPL      → binary: mush
│   └── nu_plugin_midi/   # Nushell MIDI plugin            → binary: nu_plugin_midi
│# nu_plugin_audio: reserved, not yet implemented
└── tests/                # Workspace-level PTY integration tests (expectrl)
```

### Dependency Layers

```
reedline          nu-plugin / nu-protocol
    ↑                       ↑
mush-core             nu_plugin_midi
    ↑    ↑                  ↑
    |  mish-shell ── mish-midi-core
    |  mash-shell ── mash-audio-core
    |  mush-shell ── mish-midi-core
    |             └─ mash-audio-core
tests ── mish-shell, mash-shell, mush-shell
```

## Prerequisites

- [Rust](https://rustup.rs/) stable toolchain
- [cargo-nextest](https://nexte.st/) for running tests
- [mask](https://github.com/jacobdeichert/mask) for task running

Install task runner and test runner:

```sh
cargo install mask
cargo install cargo-nextest
```

## Usage

### Shells

Run the standalone MIDI shell:

```sh
cargo run --bin mish
```

Run the standalone Audio shell:

```sh
cargo run --bin mash
```

Run the unified MIDI + Audio shell:

```sh
cargo run --bin mush
```

### Nushell Plugin

Build and register the MIDI plugin with nushell:

```sh
cargo build --package nu_plugin_midi --release
plugin add target/release/nu_plugin_midi
```

Once registered, commands are available in nushell:

```sh
midi ports
midi play
midi stop
```

## Development Tasks

## build

> Build all workspace crates

```sh
cargo build --workspace
```

## run

> Run a shell binary — usage: mask run <mish|mash|mush>

```sh
cargo run --bin "$1"
```

## test

> Run all tests (unit + integration)

```sh
cargo nextest run --package mish-midi-core --profile unit
cargo nextest run --package mash-audio-core --profile unit
cargo nextest run --package mush-core --profile unit
```

### test unit

> Run domain unit tests only (fast, parallel, no PTY)

```sh
cargo nextest run --package mish-midi-core --profile unit
cargo nextest run --package mash-audio-core --profile unit
```

### test integration

> Run PTY integration tests (sequential, requires built binaries)

```sh
cargo build --workspace
cargo nextest run --package mush-tests --profile ci
```

### test mish

> Run mish integration tests only

```sh
cargo build --bin mish
cargo nextest run --package mush-tests --test mish_tests --profile ci
```

### test mash

> Run mash integration tests only

```sh
cargo build --bin mash
cargo nextest run --package mush-tests --test mash_tests --profile ci
```

### test mush

> Run mush integration tests only

```sh
cargo build --bin mush
cargo nextest run --package mush-tests --test mush_tests --profile ci
```

### test plugin

> Check nu_plugin_midi binary exists and was built successfully

```sh
cargo build --package nu_plugin_midi
cargo nextest run --package mush-tests --test nu_plugin_midi_tests --profile ci
```

## ci

> Full CI pipeline — build, unit tests, integration tests

```sh
set -e
cargo build --workspace
cargo nextest run --package mish-midi-core --profile unit
cargo nextest run --package mash-audio-core --profile unit
cargo nextest run --package mush-tests --profile ci
```

## clean

> Remove build artifacts

```sh
cargo clean
```

## check

> Run cargo check across the workspace (fast, no codegen)

```sh
cargo check --workspace
```

## clippy

> Run clippy lints across the workspace

```sh
cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings
```

## fmt

> Format all source files

```sh
cargo fmt --all
```

## fmt-check

> Check formatting without modifying files (useful in CI)

```sh
cargo fmt --all -- --check
```

## plugin-add

> Build and register nu_plugin_midi with nushell (release build)

```sh
set -e
cargo build --package nu_plugin_midi --release
plugin add target/release/nu_plugin_midi
```
